{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31491","headline":"将离澧浦置酒野屿奉怀沈正字昆弟三人联登高第 · 李羣玉","name":"将离澧浦置酒野屿奉怀沈正字昆弟三人联登高第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春月三改兔，花枝成绿阴。\n年光东流水，浩叹伤羁心。\n酌桂烟屿晚，鴂鸣江草深。\n良图一超忽，万恨空相寻。\n上国刈翘楚，才微甘陆沈。\n无灯假贫女，有泪沾牛衾。\n衡岳三麒麟，各振黄锺音。\n卿云被文彩，芳价摇词林。\n夫子芸阁英，养鳞湘水浔。\n晴沙踏兰菊，隐几当青岑。\n明月洞庭上，悠扬挂离襟。\n停觞一摇笔，聊寄生刍吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}